English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m3dz1r51/50f640d1-f5f5-449f-a468-95c178b1d746/4e78cd50-a0b1-11ef-a557-51fc753e3547/file-jaoe38c1m3dz1r52.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Since, water molecule is lost during the reaction between amine and carboxylic acid the reaction is condensation reaction.</p>\n<p>Option (D) is correct.</p>\n<p>(iii) The compound contains carbonyl functional group of ester and cannot be reduced by hydrogen in presence of nickel. Hence, no condensation reaction is possible between ester and an acid.</p>\n<p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.186ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 6270.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g